	<string>Hotkey: assign one on the Hotkey trigger (argument: Selection in macOS). Press it to read the selection, press again to stop.
Universal Action: select text, open Universal Actions, choose "Speak with Phonon".
speak &lt;text&gt;: read typed text.
voice: pick the default voice (⌘↩ previews).
shh: stop.

Needs Ollama running with `ollama pull phonon`. Speed: `echo 1.2 &gt; ~/.config/phonon-reader/rate`.</string>
